<title>USA: CPC to buy 24.5 pct Israel Edible stake.</title>
<headline>CPC to buy 24.5 pct Israel Edible stake.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CLIFFS, N.J. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CPC International Inc said on Thursday it agreed to buy Koor Industries Ltd's 24.5 percent ownership interest in Israel Edible Products Ltd for about $37 million.</p>
<p>CPC already owned a majority interest in Israel Edible Products, which had annual sales of over $200 million.</p>
